0..52 Comment "//! This source records prefixes of a seat protocol."
53..56 Comment "//!"
57..103 Comment "//! A prefix records each completed seat move."
104..156 Comment "//! A prefix remains valid while its run stays open."
157..208 Comment "//! A monitor checks one session message at a time."
209..252 Comment "//! `Prefix(S)` holds each accepted record."
253..294 Comment "//! `Run(S)` holds only complete records."
295..298 Comment "//!"
299..360 Comment "//! The checker admits each record that the protocol accepts."
361..364 Comment "//!"
365..423 Comment "//! - see: `./seat-evolution.gandr` — complete seat runs"
